Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): embed loopback dashboard securely

Add a sandboxed WebContentsView for the configured loopback dashboard, keep authentication in the Electron session boundary, block cross-origin navigation and requests, preserve view state across Desktop routes, and recover from backend or renderer restarts.
